  {
    "key": "evt_CK11S_0008",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Uhh… Just that Koizumi is a very careful and\ndeliberate person…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CK11S_0009",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "There's no punchline to any of this?"
