    "original": "",
    "translation": "P-punchline?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CK11S_0011",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Yeah, the punchline—the part where you\ndeliver the punch."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CK11S_0012",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Like mentioning that Koizumi did something\nonce that wasn't careful at all."
